# embedded as data (see FONT-LICENSE.txt).  Cell: cap height
# 1000 units, baseline y=1000, y down.  Each glyph is
# (advance, [contours]); a contour is a FLAT list of ints
# [x0, y0, x1, y1, ...].  Outer contours wind positive,
# counter holes wind negative (non-zero fill rule).
#  * FONT_SERIF_BOLD -- Liberation Serif Bold (date, masthead)
#  * FONT_SANS_BOLD  -- Liberation Sans Bold (headlines, kickers,
#    badges, numbers, subhead, map titles)
